  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Structuring and implementing Plataforma de Resili&#xea;ncia e Educa&#xe7;&#xe3;o para a &#xc1;gua da Beira (PREAB)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Plataforma de Resili&#xea;ncia e Educa&#xe7;&#xe3;o para a &#xc1;gua da Beira (PREAB) is an initiative to strengthen the human capital needed to operate and maintain infrastructure in a sustainable manner. PREAB is a platform to bring together the demand for training, the supply of training and the development of adapted modules for the operation and sustainable management of infrastructure.The subsidy project finances the activities of the inception phase, where it will develop and implement a robust management system for the platform, continue and intensify the activities of the management committee, initiate and formalise relationships with key projects in the areas of water, sanitation and drainage and implement the first courses on the platform.At the end of the project a multi annul business plan for PREAB will be delivered. The Business Plan covers the following topics:&#x2022;	organisational structure,&#x2022;	multi annual strategy,&#x2022;	partnerships,&#x2022;	main activities and&#x2022;	finance for a period of 4 years.</narrative>
  </description>
